67	/// The run-command controls for a selected workroom (issue #7): a Run button that becomes Stop +
68	/// Restart while the command is running. Renders nothing when the project has no run command
69	/// configured (no disabled ghost). Reads run-state straight off `AppStore` — `@EnvironmentObject`
70	/// re-evaluates on `@Published` changes, so the toggle flips live (OV-A). A plain `View` (not
71	/// `ToolbarContent`) so it composes into the title-bar toolbar (`TrailingTitlebarBar`).
